COMMENT ON TABLE public.hotline_groups IS 'Sections of the emergency directory. A group with a parent appears inside that parent''s screen — "Pasay City General Hospital" under "Pasay City Hotlines". Maintained by the barangay through the admin portal, because a hotline that only a developer can correct is one that will eventually be wrong.';


